      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَبِىْءٌ</span></b>  The <i>skin,</i> or <i>slough,</i> of a serpent; (K;)
as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَبِىٌّ</span>; for it is with, and without, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ء</span>.
(TA.)

